1. Overview

This document defines the system architecture and implementation guidelines for the AI Semantic Query Platform, focusing on:
	•	Domain management
	•	Metadata generation
	•	Query execution pipeline
	•	AWS infrastructure design

The system enables users to query enterprise data using natural language while maintaining:
	•	security
	•	determinism
	•	scalability
	•	extensibility

⸻

2. Architecture Principles

2.1 Separation of Concerns

The system is divided into two main layers:

Control Plane
Handles configuration and metadata lifecycle:
	•	domain management
	•	dataset generation
	•	configuration storage

Data Plane
Handles runtime query execution:
	•	user query processing
	•	LLM planning
	•	SQL execution

⸻

2.2 LLM Responsibility Boundary

LLM is only responsible for:
	•	intent understanding
	•	query planning (QuerySpec)

LLM must NOT:
	•	generate SQL
	•	access real data
	•	infer schema dynamically

⸻

2.3 Deterministic Execution

All database queries must be:
	•	generated by code (SQL builder)
	•	validated
	•	parameterized


