9. Key Constraints (MUST FOLLOW)

9.1 Runtime Restrictions
	•	DO NOT scan database schema during query execution
	•	DO NOT let LLM generate SQL
	•	DO NOT expose real data to LLM

⸻

9.2 Architecture Rules
	•	QuerySpec is mandatory
	•	SQL must be generated by code
	•	dataset catalog must come from S3
	•	generator must run asynchronously

⸻

9.3 Security Rules
	•	database must be read-only
	•	enforce query limits
	•	enforce timeout

⸻

